{"ticker":"MSTR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:00:13Z","profile":{"longName":"Strategy Inc","shortName":"Strategy Inc","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.strategy.com","fullTimeEmployees":1539,"marketCap":55280414720,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":5.51373,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":110.92755,"pegRatio":2.85,"targetMeanPrice":239.26666,"targetHighPrice":435.0,"targetLowPrice":165.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.069,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.67600995,"operatingMargins":-68.081116,"profitMargins":0.0,"totalRevenue":498347008,"beta":3.571,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":276.32,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":81.81,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Strategy Inc, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a bitcoin treasury company in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. It offers investors varying degrees of economic exposure to Bitcoin by offering a range of securities, including equity and fixed income instruments. The company also provides AI-powered enterprise analytics software, including Strategy One, which provides non-technical users with the ability to directly access novel and actionable insights for decision-making. In addition, the company provides Strategy Mosaic, a universal intelligence layer that offers enterprises with consistent definitions and governance across data sources, regardless of where that data resides or which tools access it. The company was formerly known as MicroStrategy Incorporated and changed its name to Strategy Inc in August 2025. The company was incorporated in 1989 and is headquartered in Tysons Corner, Virginia.","summary_zh":"Strategy Inc 及其子公司作為一家比特幣財務公司在美國、歐洲、中東、非洲和國際上運作。它透過提供一系列證券（包括股票和固定收益工具）為投資者提供不同程度的比特幣經濟風險。該公司還提供由人工智慧驅動的企業分析軟體，包括Strategy One，它使非技術用戶能夠直接存取新穎且可操作的決策見解。此外，該公司還提供Strategy Mosaic，這是一個通用智慧層，可為企業提供跨資料來源的一致定義和治理，無論資料位於何處或使用哪些工具存取它。該公司前身為 MicroStrategy Incorporated，於 2025 年 8 月更名為 Strategy Inc。該公司成立於 1989 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州泰森斯角。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":334.93,"h":348.6,"l":331.57,"c":341.62,"v":11123000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":341.77,"h":344.5,"l":327.61,"c":330.26,"v":9180200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":330.0,"h":332.56,"l":317.75,"c":327.59,"v":10530000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":334.81,"h":337.2,"l":320.0,"c":335.87,"v":14047600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":328.11,"h":333.1,"l":321.5,"c":329.9,"v":9954500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":330.23,"h":331.96,"l":324.45,"c":328.53,"v":6587800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":332.8,"h":340.01,"l":321.96,"c":326.45,"v":9741400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":326.87,"h":329.75,"l":322.77,"c":326.02,"v":7506900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":329.15,"h":336.13,"l":327.6,"c":331.44,"v":10809900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":329.4,"h":331.33,"l":320.45,"c":327.79,"v":9527700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":329.23,"h":335.44,"l":324.84,"c":335.09,"v":8651300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":335.66,"h":340.11,"l":323.21,"c":329.71,"v":9691000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":335.86,"h":358.25,"l":334.63,"c":349.12,"v":19697300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":347.45,"h":352.92,"l":337.07,"c":344.75,"v":17699700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":337.02,"h":341.59,"l":329.0,"c":335.93,"v":10053500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":337.06,"h":339.0,"l":327.77,"c":327.78,"v":9468800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":330.63,"h":337.06,"l":323.14,"c":323.31,"v":9153100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":316.61,"h":317.0,"l":292.36,"c":300.7,"v":22087000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":301.3,"h":310.0,"l":297.71,"c":309.06,"v":11693400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":313.73,"h":327.99,"l":311.0,"c":326.42,"v":12652000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":320.83,"h":324.5,"l":316.19,"c":322.21,"v":7798800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":332.47,"h":343.73,"l":331.2,"c":338.41,"v":13994800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":348.57,"h":353.22,"l":341.15,"c":352.33,"v":13666800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":350.87,"h":358.54,"l":344.4,"c":351.63,"v":12107900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":362.95,"h":365.21,"l":354.7,"